      "normalized_section_title": "hyperparameter sensitivity analysis.",
      "window_text": "The model has three $\\lambda_{1},\\lambda_{2},\\lambda_{3}$ weight hyperparameters. Preliminary tests showed that it was difficult to find a set of hyperparameters that performed optimally across all datasets. Based on prior experience [1], we set the main task weight $\\lambda_{1}$ to 1 and the reconstruction loss weight $\\lambda_{3}$ to 0.1. We mainly analyzed the impact of different weights $\\lambda_{2}$ for constraint losses in Proxy Modality Generation. The detailed analysis is shown in Table 15.\n\nTable 8: Robustness evaluation results of P-RMF on MOSI under various rates of intra-modal missing data.   \n\n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Missing Rate r</td><td colspan=\"6\">MOSI</td></tr><tr><td>Acc-2</td><td>F1</td><td>Acc-5</td><td>Acc-7</td><td>MAE</td><td>Corr</td></tr><tr><td>0.0</td><td>82.65 / 84 15</td><td>82.69 / 84 37</td><td>48 83</td><td>44 31</td><td>0.726</td><td>0.782</td></tr><tr><td>0.1</td><td>81.34 / 82 62</td><td>81.35 / 82 89</td><td>47 52</td><td>42 13</td><td>0.800</td><td>0.730</td></tr><tr><td>0.2</td><td>78.13 / 79 57</td><td>78.11 / 80 97</td><td>44 75</td><td>40 38</td><td>0.853</td><td>0.668</td></tr><tr><td>0.3</td><td>75.80 / 76 83</td><td>75.82 / 79 27</td><td>42 71</td><td>39 21</td><td>0.922</td><td>0.621</td></tr><tr><td>0.4</td><td>73.76 / 75 46</td><td>74.09 / 77 71</td><td>40 67</td><td>35 59</td><td>1.001</td><td>0.584</td></tr><tr><td>0.5</td><td>71.28 / 73 02</td><td>71.66 / 73 33</td><td>37 90</td><td>33 67</td><td>1.077</td><td>0.523</td></tr><tr><td>0.6</td><td>67.35 / 68 75</td><td>67.64 / 68 64</td><td>33 24</td><td>29 30</td><td>1.147</td><td>0.432</td></tr><tr><td>0.7</td><td>65.16 / 66 16</td><td>65.33 / 64 69</td><td>32 94</td><td>27 84</td><td>1.229</td><td>0.383</td></tr><tr><td>0.8</td><td>61.08 / 62 04</td><td>61.22 / 60 76</td><td>29 74</td><td>25 97</td><td>1.275</td><td>0.316</td></tr><tr><td>0.9</td><td>58.75 / 59 45</td><td>59.01 / 56 66</td><td>26 68</td><td>23 49</td><td>1.346<